 # Aegis Golden Path (v1)
 
+## Redis-backed rate limiting / quotas (follow-up patch)
+
+This patch replaces DB-backed enforcement with Redis counters for accuracy and performance.
+
+Enable:
+- Set `AEGIS_REDIS_URL=redis://<host>:6379/0`
+- Optional: Helm can deploy a dev Redis (`helm/aegis`):
+  - set `redis.enabled=true`
+
+Limits are defined per deployment in `deployments.limits`:
+- `max_rpm`
+- `max_daily_units`
+
+Notes:
+- This uses fixed windows (60s for rpm, 1 day for quota). Upgrade to sliding window/token bucket if needed.
+
